he heart of Versova, Andheri West, one of Mumbai’s most coveted addresses. Thoughtfully designed to offer a lifestyle that blends luxury, comfort, and connectivity, this premium development features spacious 2, 3 \u0026 4 BHK homes. Spread across a 30,000+ sq. ft. lifestyle podium, it offers a plethora of international-standard amenities to elevate your everyday living. Each home is crafted to reflect sophistication, with features that promote active lifestyles, well-being, and modern community living. From the exclusive Terrace Boulevard to curated wellness and leisure spaces, Adcore Westwood redefines elevated urban living. With seamless access to entertainment hubs, metro stations, and commercial zones, this is where the city’s glamour meets peaceful, premium living.","project_area_range":"767-1550 sq. ft.","carpetArea":"767 - 1550 sqft","possession":"31 Dec 2029","construction_status":"Under construction","avgPrice":"42895","reraId":"P51800056187","configuration":"2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK","configuration_short":"2, 3, 4 BHK","highlights":["Luxurious Mix of 2, 3 \u0026 4 Bed Residences \u0026 Palatial Duplex Residences","Panoramic Sea-view For Select Residences","- 2 Basement + 4 Podium + 20 Habitable Floors","30,000 Sq. Ft. plus of Lifestyle Podium with a Plethora of International Standard      Amenities","Terrace Boulevard with Amenities"],"projectType":"Residential"},"AmenitiesProps":{"AmenitiesData":[{"icon":"Amphitheatre","id":111,"name":"Amphitheatre"},{"icon":"gym","id":49,"name":"Gymnasium"},{"icon":"jogging","id":57,"name":"Jogging / Cycle Track"},{"icon":"kids-play-areas","id":54,"name":"Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits"},{"icon":"kids-pool","id":63,"name":"Kids Pool"},{"icon":"large-green-area","id":34,"name":"Large Green Area"},{"icon":"Multi-purpose-court","id":80,"name":"Multipurpose Hall"},{"icon":"Cafeteria","id":87,"name":"Open Air Cafe"},{"icon":"snooker-pool-billiards","id":59,"name":"Snooker / Billiards"},{"icon":"spa","id":39,"name":"Spa"}]},"BrochureP