ulatory Authority)","url":"https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in","reraLink":"https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800056187"}},"BookPropertyEnabled":false,"structuredData":["\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org/\",\n  \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\",\n  \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Mumbai\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Properties in Mumbai\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/1a256\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Properties in Andheri West\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/andheri-west-1a256b7a6\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Adcore Developers\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/andheri-west-adcore-developers-1a256b7a6b13a6826\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Adcore Westwood\",\"item\":\"https://blox.xyz/projects/adcore-westwood\"}]\n}","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When is the possession date for Adcore Westwood?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Possession date of Adcore Westwood is 31 Dec 2029\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the RERA carpet area range of Adcore Westwood?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The RERA carpet area range for Adcore Westwood is 767 - 1550 sqft\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the price range of Adcore Westwood?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The price range of Adcore Westwood is ₹3.29 Cr - 6.65 Cr\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is Adcore Westwood located?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Adcore Westwood is located at Adcore Westwood, JP Rd, next to Kamdhenu, opp. Kokilabehn Hospital, Versova, Andheri, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400053.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What configurations are available in Adcore Westwood?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Adcore Westwood has 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK configurations.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the status of Adcore Westwood?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The status of Adcore Westwood is Under construction.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which amenities are provided in Adcore Westwood?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The amenities are Amphitheatre, Gymnasium, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Kids Pool, Large Green Area, Multipurpose Hall, Open Air Cafe, Snooker / Billiards, Spa.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is the developer of Adcore Westwood?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The developer of Adcore Westwood is Adcore Developers.\"}}]\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Product\",\n  \"name\": \"Adcore Westwood\",\n  \"image\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/070825050331-1745386164455-d-logo-1.webp\",\n  \"description\": \"Adcore Westwood by Adcore Developers is an upscale residential project located in the heart of Versova, Andheri West, one of Mumbai’s most coveted addresses. Thoughtfully designed to offer a lifestyle that blends luxury, comfort, and connectivity, this premium development features spacious 2, 3 \u0026 4 BHK homes. Spread across a 30,000+ sq. ft. lifestyle podium, it offers a plethora of international-standard amenities to elevate your everyday living. Each home is crafted to reflect sophistication, with features that promote active lifestyles, well-being, and modern community living. From the exclusive Terrace Boulevard to curated wellness and leisure spaces, Adcore Westwood redefines elevated urban living. With seamless access to entertainment hubs, metro stations, and commercial zones, this is where the city’s glamour meets peaceful, premium living.\",\n  \"brand\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"Brand\",\n\t\t\"name\": \"Adcore Developers\"\n\t},\n  \"offers\": {\n\t\t\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\",\n    \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/adcore-westwood\",\n\t\t\"priceCurrency\": \"INR\",\n\t\t\"lowPrice\": \"32900465.00\",\n\t\t\"highPrice\": \"66487250.00\"\n\t}\n}\n","\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": [\n      \"SingleFamilyResidence\",\n      \"Product\",\n      \"RealEstateListing\"\n  ],\n  \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/adcore-westwood\",\n  \"mpn\": \"P51800056187\",\n  \"brand\": {\n    \"@type\": \"Brand\",\n    \"@id\": \"https://blox.xyz/buy/mumbai/adcore-developers-1a256b13a6826\",\n    \"name\": \"Adcore Developers\"\n  },\n  \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/adcore-westwood\",\n  \"containedInPlace\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Place\",\n      \"@id\": \"Adcore Westwood\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/adcore-westwood\",\n      \"name\": \"Adcore Westwood\",\n      \"address\": {\n          \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n          \"streetAddress\": \"Adcore Westwood, JP Rd, next to Kamdhenu, opp. Kokilabehn Hospital, Versova, Andheri, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400053\",\n          \"addressLocality\": \"Andheri West\",\n          \"addressRegion\": \"Mumbai\",\n          \"postalCode\": \"400053\",\n          \"addressCountry\": \"IN\"\n      }\n  },\n  \"description\": \"Adcore Westwood by Adcore Developers is an upscale residential project located in the heart of Versova, Andheri West, one of Mumbai’s most coveted addresses. Thoughtfully designed to offer a lifestyle that blends luxury, comfort, and connectivity, this premium development features spacious 2, 3 \u0026 4 BHK homes. Spread across a 30,000+ sq. ft. lifestyle podium, it offers a plethora of international-standard amenities to elevate your everyday living. Each home is crafted to reflect sophistication, with features that promote active lifestyles, well-being, and modern community living. From the exclusive Terrace Boulevard to curated wellness and leisure spaces, Adcore Westwood redefines elevated urban living. With seamless access to entertainment hubs, metro stations, and commercial zones, this is where the city’s glamour meets peaceful, premium living.\",\n  \"floorSize\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"QuantitativeValue\",\n          \"unitCode\": \"SQFT\",\n          \"minValue\": \"767\",\n          \"maxValue\": \"1550\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"image\": [\n      {\n          \"@type\": \"ImageObject\",\n          \"url\": \"https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/070825050331-1745386164455-d-logo-1.webp\"\n      }\n  ],\n  \"name\": \"Adcore Westwood\",\n  \"offers\": {\n      \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n      \"@id\": \"P51800056187\",\n      \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n      \"name\": \"Sale of Adcore Westwood Unit\",\n      \"url\": \"https://blox.xyz/projects/adcore-westwood\",\n      \"price\": 32900465.00,\n      \"priceCurrency\": \"INR\"\n  }\n}\n"],"googleReviews":{"html_attributions":[],"result":{"rating":4.8,"reviews":[{"author_name":"Chirag Patel","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101765235688909334282/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKqmyKMX2Ou8EchEE-ra1w9x6OWnVe843ayVGeeourqSWIOZA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"a year ago","text":"Construction quality is good work is in full swing. They have recently started selling flats at a good value.","time":1733557369,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Kashish Sayyed","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114975945421272444597/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK-eJuktPjVQArEdJFTG9DxMJmK775ko5Qd95ItrVr4co0rtA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"9 months ago","text":"Best project by far ❤️\nNot like others scam","time":1763893321,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Shamin Shaikh","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112841431833734747587/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVK1m3o8N-tTrfoyDy-AazBt3CmoFEVK2hVfFLUFLILWJbh1zQOHg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"9 months ago","text":"Great staff , treat people with kindness and treat their employees as families","time":1763893149,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Kashish Shaikh","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100735012748445672676/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJKO743tschLI44vgGET882J20-JKxXkENSvNNuIMlBVAz8=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"9 months ago","text":"The staff adcore has is fabbb ❤️\nThey treat people how they should be treated good to goods bad to bads i like the equality","time":1763893247,"translated":false},{"author_name":"Huzaifa Sayyed","author_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106627362988480284139/reviews","language":"en","original_language":"en","profile_photo_url":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW58zeuxztTZaXABA31dFjlmBUAiXL3l6DcJAFT8FS74tMJo4jB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo","rating":5,"relative_time_description":"9 months ago","text":"Great safff and greatt project i looved the sea view","time":1763893592,"translated":false}],"url":"https://maps.google.com/?cid=17985668354172948429","user_ratings_total":13},"status":"OK"},"aiReviewSummary":null},"isMobile":false,"footerData":{"featured":{"kolkata":{"label":"Kolkata","id":14},"mumbai":{"label":"Mumbai","id":256},"navi-mumbai":{"label":"Navi Mumbai","id":261},"pune":{"label":"Pune","id":300},"thane":{"label":"Thane","id":269}},"others":{"alibaug":{"label":"Alibaug","id":1907},"bangalore":{"label":"Bangalore","id":95},"noida":{"label":"Noida","id":84},"palghar":{"label":"Palghar","id":264},"raigad":{"label":"Raigad","id":3323},"telangana":{"label":"Telangana","id":3326}}},"__N_SSP":true}